ure effects that Taco Bell will have on my soul whilst attempting to finish my 32oz can of Steel Reserve has led me to one and only one conclusion: Fire sauce i..."},{"business_id":"Q9GU2OvZObDVyA00ZJkFaA","review_id":"qP-IHZajmgtG8ghltQ0o8A","date":"2016-11-06T17:29:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8844338655471802,"text_excerpt":"One of the cleaner eating establishments in this area. Workers seem to be constantly working. The manager is very attentive to both the customers and the product being served. All employees chip in to get the customer served. Food quality is typical Taco Bell quality, but the new Rolled chicken tacos are bland and not a great value. Good Job Manager, you run a tight ship. Your radio kept losing its connection btw."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Q9GU2OvZObDVyA00ZJkFaA","photo_id":"90KCeOi1lDDi32dCuEd4vQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/90KCeOi1lDDi32dCuEd4vQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9372473955154419},{"business_id":"Q9GU2OvZObDVyA00ZJkFaA","photo_id":"2kWh1pzWv-lV-VjNHEH71A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/2kWh1pzWv-lV-VjNHEH71A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8833568096160889},{"business_id":"Q9GU2OvZObDVyA00ZJkFaA","photo_id":"eGwSyb0zIIEAsAQQNF4WMQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/eGwSyb0zIIEAsAQQNF4WMQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8461532592773438},{"business_id":"Q9GU2OvZObDVyA00ZJkFaA","photo_id":"jXsAdv_D-KsCElkBb8oJuw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jXsAdv_D-KsCElkBb8oJuw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.817571759223938}]},"notebook_case":null}
